<title>USA: Ashworth names Randall Herrel president.</title>
<headline>Ashworth names Randall Herrel president.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, Calif. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ashworth Inc said on Wednesday that Randall Herrel will be joining the company on December 9 as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Herrell was formerly the president of Quiksilver Inc.</p>
<p>Chairman Gerald Montiel has been acting as president since January when Rich Werschkul resigned that position to pursue other opportunities.</p>
<p>Herrel has signed an initial three year management contract with the Ashworth.</p>
